===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|en|computer}}. Further from {{der|ru|la|computō}}. Cognates include {{cog|uk|комп'ю́тер}}.

Note natively formed {{m+|cs|počítač}} (i.e. ''**почитач''), {{m+|sh|редник}} (i.e. ''**рядник'').

